	"Name": "Big Garage with Seasonal Immersion",
	"Author": "HopeWasHere",
	"TagLine": "Makes your stable and tractor garage one large building that changes with the seasons!",
	"Description": "Using a vehicle mod for your horse and the stable stands out? Would you like a garage to store that bike, scooter, or whatever else? This mod is the one for you!\n\nUsing lambui's Tractor Mod: http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/gameplay-mod-tractor-mod.126955/ you can have a large garage to store your toys.\n\nNow with seasonal Immersion!!\n(http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/smapi-seasonal-immersion.125683/)\n\nThis mod goes great with Pi.Curious' Horse to Vespa Scooter Mod: http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/horse-to-vespa-scooter-garage-joja-scooter-added.110212/\n\nIf you want to ride a scooter around, but still want to see cute horses around your farm, check out this mod here: http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/905/?\n\nFor troubleshooting and other mods by me, check out the official discussion here: http://community.playstarbound.com/threads/garages-horses-and-hair-oh-my.130359/ ",
